              </a>

              <a href="mailto:email@exemplo.com" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[#f8f9fa] hover:bg-[#fff0f0] text-[#333] hover:text-[#d90429] no-underline transition-colors">
